MaiBot built-in typo dictionary

This file is a derived list of correct-word and typo pairs.

Reviewed entries come from pycorrector's tests/custom_confusion.txt.
Source revision: fc8aa56c336276fbd8cdd3a49eef505dc67b8a6e
https://github.com/shibing624/pycorrector/blob/fc8aa56c336276fbd8cdd3a49eef505dc67b8a6e/tests/custom_confusion.txt

