https://huggingface.co/datasets/shibing624/CSC
Training revision: 40f6a4b1a42c0bcb74aaf1ea3c8bba5ce140b021
train.json SHA-256: 4d947b7c6de671783c9809e90ceeca5142dc716914b06d2f31d0ba3f1eef0dd4

MaiBot extracted 2–4-character word pairs with a single same-pronunciation
substitution from aligned training samples. Extraction filters proper names,
number words, low-frequency characters, known meaning-changing pairs and
variants that occur as complete words or phrases in multiple corrected texts.
Repeated observations are preferred. Single observations supplement common
words with no stronger candidate. Reviewed pycorrector entries take priority
for the words they cover. Original training sentences are not distributed.

See typo_words.LICENSE for the Apache License 2.0.
